{"assets":["/statement-assets/86e9a57d20106e90c5c8c96afb01ca116c5d33b76e7c782a728b921bfbf076dd.png","/statement-assets/eb706d9d25df4dffcf2cdfe10d4d2f2b2321a957c061b7175908254966ebbb99.png","/statement-assets/14a32644523931d255469b1a10b0b65e087bea3ffb94f440671625a28d80e100.png","/statement-assets/68744786d8052b38bc3a8b5d21773e4d9eefe03ba776bc9a4835f898f83a4598.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2178","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G. deCH OR Dations"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Due to supply chain issues in the North Pole (allegedly caused by a lazy elf), Santa is planning to give out hand-drawn circles as presents this Christmas. Please help him decorate them!"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are $$$2n$$$ equally spaced points around the circle, labeled $$$1,2,\\ldots,2n$$$ in clockwise order. Santa has chosen $$$n$$$ chords with "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"distinct"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" endpoints, where chord $$$i$$$ connects the points $$$a_i$$$ and $$$b_i$$$. He draws these chords onto the circle one by one, in order. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After Santa has drawn the first $$$\\ell$$$ chords, consider any non-empty subset $$$S$$$ of the $$$\\ell$$$ chords and let $$$1\\leq c_1 \\lt c_2 \\lt \\cdots \\lt c_{|S|}\\leq \\ell$$$ be their indices. $$$S$$$ is defined to be a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chain"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if and only if chord $$$c_k$$$ intersects chord $$$c_{k+1}$$$ for all $$$1\\leq k \\lt |S|$$$. Note that $$$S$$$ is always a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chain"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if $$$|S|=1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Santa does not want any chord to be the odd one out. Therefore, he considers the chords to be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tight-knit"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if and only if every chord appears in an even number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", taken over all "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" that are subsets of the first $$$\\ell$$$ chords."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each $$$\\ell$$$ from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$, help Santa determine whether his chords are "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tight-knit"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2\\le n\\le 5\\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of chords."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then $$$n$$$ lines follow, the $$$i$$$-th line containing two integers $$$a_i$$$ and $$$b_i$$$ ($$$1\\le a_i \\lt b_i\\le 2n$$$) — the endpoints of the $$$i$$$-th chord."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that all endpoints are distinct."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$5\\cdot 10^5$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output a string of length $$$n$$$ — the $$$\\ell$$$-th character should be $$$\\texttt{1}$$$ if the first $$$\\ell$$$ chords are "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tight-knit"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and $$$\\texttt{0}$$$ otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n3\n1 6\n2 3\n4 5\n4\n1 7\n3 8\n4 6\n2 5\n5\n1 6\n4 9\n2 7\n5 10\n3 8\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n000\n0100\n01111\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, no pairs of chords intersect, and thus every chord appears in exactly one "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chain"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" consisting of itself. Therefore, the chords are not "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tight-knit"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" for all $$$\\ell$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, below is an illustration and explanation after the first $$$\\ell=1,2,3,4$$$ chords are drawn. Sets of chords are denoted as a set of the indices of the corresponding chords."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Explanation"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Illustration"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\{1\\}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Appearances"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Chord $$$1$$$ appears in $$$1$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chain"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Notes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The chords are not "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tight-knit"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" since chord $$$1$$$ is in an odd number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Recall that a set containing a single chord is always a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chain"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/86e9a57d20106e90c5c8c96afb01ca116c5d33b76e7c782a728b921bfbf076dd.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\{1\\}$$$, $$$\\{1,2\\}$$$, and $$$\\{2\\}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Appearances"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Chord $$$1$$$ appears in $$$2$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Chord $$$2$$$ appears in $$$2$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Notes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The chords are "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tight-knit"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" since every chord appears in an even number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/eb706d9d25df4dffcf2cdfe10d4d2f2b2321a957c061b7175908254966ebbb99.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\{1\\}$$$, $$$\\{1,2\\}$$$, $$$\\{2\\}$$$, and $$$\\{3\\}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Appearances"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Chord $$$1$$$ appears in $$$2$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Chord $$$2$$$ appears in $$$2$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Chord $$$3$$$ appears in $$$1$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chain"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Notes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The chords are not "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tight-knit"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" since chord $$$3$$$ is in an odd number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/14a32644523931d255469b1a10b0b65e087bea3ffb94f440671625a28d80e100.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\{1\\}$$$, $$$\\{1,2\\}$$$, $$$\\{1,2,4\\}$$$, $$$\\{2\\}$$$, $$$\\{2,4\\}$$$, $$$\\{3\\}$$$, $$$\\{3,4\\}$$$, and $$$\\{4\\}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Appearances"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Chord $$$1$$$ appears in $$$3$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Chord $$$2$$$ appears in $$$4$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Chord $$$3$$$ appears in $$$2$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Chord $$$4$$$ appears in $$$4$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Notes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The chords are not "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tight-knit"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" since chord $$$1$$$ is in an odd number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chains"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Note that $$$\\{2,3,4\\}$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"not"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"chain"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" since chord $$$2$$$ does not intersect chord $$$3$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/68744786d8052b38bc3a8b5d21773e4d9eefe03ba776bc9a4835f898f83a4598.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Thus, we output $$$\\mathtt{0100}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"G","problemCode":"2178G","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2178/problem/G"}